do GameManager.lock_player()
ShopMan: That was... more than I expected. Looks like we got a real case on our hands, kid.
ShopMan: NOT your fault. Don't blame yourself for this one. It's on me this time!
ShopMan: I need to layout out for you rookie, this is only going to get harder from here on out.
ShopMan: BUT
ShopMan: I might be able to, you know, take the edge off things a little bit so to speak.
